      "treatment_summary": "Supportive care; phenobarbital for four months in early infancy after a febrile convulsive seizure; colchicine and intermittent courses of prednisolone without meaningful improvement (several months of colchicine); after the genetic diagnosis, escalated to infliximab 5 mg/kg at weeks 0, 2 and 6 then maintenance every eight weeks, colchicine discontinued and corticosteroids tapered, with significant clinical improvement and only one self-limited febrile episode over an eight-month follow-up.",
